       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.

       PROGRAM-ID.     CPOLOGUSR.
       AUTHOR.         EXLTECH, INC - DAN RAUCH
      ***************************************************************
      **                     C P O L O G U S R
      ***************************************************************
      ** THIS PROGRAM RETRIEVES PO TRIGGER RECORD AND CALLS THE
      ** PO LOGGING ROUTINE TO WRITE A PO LOG RECORD
      ***************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************

      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *   APRIL 01 2003      DAN RAUCH
      *   INITIAL AUTHOR   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      *   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *   MONTH DD CCYY      XXXXXXXXXX
      *   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
                                                                       *
      *================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      *===============================================================
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.         LOCAL-DATA IS LDA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT CPOLOG-TRG-FILE ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPCS7300
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

      *================================================================
       DATA DIVISION.
      *================================================================
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  CPOLOG-TRG-FILE.
       01  CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPCS7300.


      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY FILESTATUS  OF COPYLIB.
       COPY CPOLOGPRM   IN COPYLIB.

      *============================================================
      *===              L I N K A G E    S E C T I O N
      *============================================================
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LS-USER                   PIC X(10).
       01  LS-JOB                    PIC X(10).
       01  LS-JNBR                   PIC X(06).

      *================================================================
      *===        P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N              ===
      *================================================================
       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING LS-USER  LS-JOB  LS-JNBR.
       0000-PROGRAM-ENTRY.

           OPEN  INPUT  CPOLOG-TRG-FILE.

           PERFORM 1000-MAIN-LOGIC       THRU 1000-EXIT.

           CLOSE        CPOLOG-TRG-FILE.

       0000-PROGRAM-END.
           GOBACK.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  RETRIEVE TRIGGER SCRATCH RECORD AND CALL PO LOGGING PGM
      *****************************************************************
       1000-MAIN-LOGIC.

           PERFORM 9000-READK-CPOLOG-TRG  THRU 9000-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               GO TO 1000-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2000-CALL-CPOLOG       THRU 2000-EXIT.

       1000-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *************************************************************    ****
      * BUILD PARM LIST AND CALL PO UPD LOG PROGRAM - CPOLOG           D
      *************************************************************    ****
       2000-CALL-CPOLOG.

           INITIALIZE  LS-CPOLOG-PARMS.

           MOVE  PLANT          TO LS-CPOLOG-PLANT-CODE.
           MOVE  JPONO          TO LS-CPOLOG-PO-NUMBER.
           MOVE  EVNTCD         TO LS-CPOLOG-IO-EVNTCD.
           MOVE  EVNTDS         TO LS-CPOLOG-IO-EVNTDS.

           CALL "CPOLOG"  USING LS-CPOLOG-PARMS.

       2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY CPOLOG TRG FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9000-READK-CPOLOG-TRG.

           INITIALIZE CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
           MOVE  LS-USER          TO USER     OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
           MOVE  LS-JOB           TO JOBNAME  OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
           MOVE  LS-JNBR          TO JNUMBER  OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC.

           READ CPOLOG-TRG-FILE
           END-READ.

       9000-READK-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***                  END OF SOURCE
      *****************************************************************
